WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.215
The Tarantula, inside the Cloud.

00:02.994 --> 00:07.789
The bright knot is the Tarantula Nebula, the brightest nursery of stars near us.

00:08.351 --> 00:14.804
It is part of the Large Magellanic Cloud and shares its distance; its depth within the disc is not known.
